==History==
2024
*The Mega Knight’s Evolution was made available on 30/8/2024, before its release date, as an unintended glitch. Supercell fixed this glitch with a maintenance break.
*The Mega Knight's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 14/9/2024.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]] added a sound effect to the Evolved Mega Knight after death. It also fixed various bugs with the Evolved Mega Knight.
2025
*On 15/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (15/1/2025)|maintenance break]] made it so that Evolved Mega Knight would no longer jump on enemies that were knocked back by his attack.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] increased the Evolved Mega Knight's spawn damage by 0.23%. It also fixed a few bugs where [[Electro Giant]] would not always be knocked back when hit by Evolved Mega Knight and ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] being able to cross the river after being knocked up by Evolved Mega Knight.
*On 6/10/2025, a Balance Update, made it so that the Evolved Mega Knight would no longer be grabbed by the [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Evolved Goblin Cage]] while it is jumping in mid-air
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Mega Knight's knockback against large troops to 2.5 tiles (from 4 tiles)
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, made it so that the Evolved Mega Knight knocks back troops every 2 hits instead of every hit. It also increased the Evolved Mega Knight's knockback against large troops to 4 tiles (from 2.5 tiles)

